compose-swing-ui :: swing-ui-animation-core

This module contains source code copied and adapted from the Android Open Source
Project's Jetpack Compose animation-core library, redistributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

  Original: androidx.compose.animation:animation-core 1.13.0
            (AndroidX commit ac6d2ce3d991b07d9b981d616bddc6d3ab461eab)
  Copyright The Android Open Source Project

Adaptations: flattened from Kotlin Multiplatform (expect/actual) to a single JVM
source set; the package was relocated from androidx.compose.animation.core to
org.jetbrains.compose.swing.animation.core; compose-ui geometry/unit converters
and Path-based easing were removed, and java.awt.Dimension and java.awt.Point
converters stand in for the IntSize and IntOffset ones; the cubic Bezier easing
helpers and the ui-util fast math, list and Float packing helpers were vendored
from androidx.compose.ui. Animations that never end use the InfiniteAnimationPolicy
of this project's swing-ui-core module, and motion is scaled by the
MotionDurationScale declared there. See per-file headers for original copyright
years.

